---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_NAMES } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
const updated = '2026-10-06';
---
<PageLayout title={`Cookies – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="TaxiNoir sets no cookies: the calculators for taxi, ride-hailing and ambulance drivers keep nothing. Only site stability is measured, anonymously and cookie-free." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>TaxiNoir <strong>sets no cookies</strong> during your visit. There is no banner either, since there is nothing to accept. For details of processing, see the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>The calculators keep nothing</h2>
    <p>A driver’s net income, VAT on fares, the renewal timetable for the professional card: these tools run in your browser. Number of rides, fares, vehicle costs and turnover are sent nowhere and are written neither to a cookie nor to browser storage; they are gone when you close the page. The publisher records no personal data.</p>
    <h2>Only stability is measured</h2>
    <p>To find out whether a page crashes or a calculator takes too long to appear, the site uses Microsoft Clarity in <strong>cookie-free</strong> mode. It notes errors, loading times, clicks that lead nowhere and scrolling, nothing more. No Clarity cookie (<code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>) or Microsoft cookie (<code>MUID</code>, <code>CLID</code>) is set; each page view has a separate identifier and visits are never matched up. Page text and the amounts you enter are masked before sending.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Tool provider: Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Ireland;</li>
      <li>retention: 30 days for recordings, 13 months for aggregates;</li>
      <li>basis: the publisher’s legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>No other measurement tool, no advertising, no social media button.</p>
    <h2>The calculator embedded on another site</h2>
    <p>The iframe version of the calculator offered to other sites does not load Clarity and sets no cookies.</p>
    <h2>Refusing the stability measurement</h2>
    <p>Block the clarity.ms domain in your browser settings or with a blocker: guides and calculators work just the same. You can also write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> or complain to the CNIL, the French data protection authority. Updated: {updated}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
